<title>RUSSIA: Russia's St Petersburg Intl Telephone H1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Russia's St Petersburg Intl Telephone H1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Russia 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>				 1996		   1995</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 94.80 bln rbls     50.70 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Net profit	     67.10 bln rbls     32.20 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Sales		   374.30 bln rbls    176.90 bln rbls</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name OAO Sankt-Peterburgsky Mezhdugorodny Mezhdunarodny Telefon  SMMT.RTS. Figures to Russian accounting standards.</p>
<p>Major shareholder is state telecoms holding company AO Svyazinvest with 50.70 percent of shares, corporate bodies, including OFI Group with 10 percent, hold 38.60 percent and individuals have 10.70 percent.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
